              <Comment>
                <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">Acceleration for jogging (Value &gt; 0.0: The specified value is used; Value = 0.0: Not permitted; Value &lt; 0.0: Use of the default value configured in the technology object)</MultiLanguageText>
