            <Member Name="mode" Datatype="DInt">
              <Comment>
                <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">0: Continuous jogging; 1: Incremental jogging new increment (starts with new increment); 2: Incremental jogging continue increment (continue the last increment if not completed)</MultiLanguageText>
